    "Bounds as %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "边界以 %@ 表示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bounds as a radius window in mm; the optimizer bounds the curvature c = 1/R. Empty is open on that side. Min above max wraps through flat (R = ∞): min 100, max −100 is |R| ≥ 100. 0 leaves the curvature unbounded on that side." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以毫米为单位的半径范围边界；优化器约束的是曲率 c = 1/R。留空表示该侧无边界。最小值大于最大值时经过平面（R = ∞）：最小值 100、最大值 −100 即 |R| ≥ 100。0 表示该侧曲率不设边界。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bounds in %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
