        }
      }
    },
    "The engine could not rebuild this build: no ray reached the image." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "引擎无法重建该成品：没有光线到达像面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine evaluates the built-in pattern analytically at each pixel's exact source point (through the distortion), averaged over the pixel: no bitmap in between, so the blur is the lens's. The source shown here is drawn with the same definition." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "引擎在每个像素的精确源点（经畸变映射）处解析计算内置图案，并在像素内取平均：中间不经过位图，因此模糊完全来自镜头。此处显示的源图像按相同定义绘制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine found no problems in the design" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "引擎未在设计中发现问题"
