            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件中的玻璃与之前相同（%lld 种）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first trials keep their perturbations and compensator values for the trial list and the CSV export (at most 10 000). Any trial can be previewed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "前若干次试验会保留其扰动和补偿器值，用于试验列表和 CSV 导出（最多 10 000 次）。任何试验都可预览。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The glass has no name." : {
