    },
    "The interferometer wavelength: one test fringe is half a wave of sag at it. Power and irregularity tolerances are counted in these fringes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "干涉仪波长：一个检验光圈对应该波长下半个波长的矢高。光焦度和不规则度公差以这些光圈计数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layout is out of date. Click to update it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "布局图已过期。点击以更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The mean square RMS spot radius over the chosen fields and wavelengths, by their weights." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
