          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The melt's Abbe-number offset from the catalog V_d (within ±%@)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "熔炼批次阿贝数相对玻璃库 V_d 的偏差（±%@ 以内）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The melt's index offset from the catalog n_d (within ±%@); the dispersion keeps its shape." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "熔炼批次折射率相对玻璃库 n_d 的偏差（±%@ 以内）；色散曲线形状不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The merit at the current design, before optimizing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "优化前当前设计的评价函数值。"
          }
