    },
    "The minimum is above the maximum." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最小值大于最大值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The nearest glasses" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最接近的玻璃"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The order rays follow; 0 is ordinary refraction or reflection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光线所走的级次；0 为普通折射或反射。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The order the structure is designed for (nonzero). Metadata: it does not rescale the phase." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结构的设计级次（非零）。仅为元数据，不会缩放相位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The parameter no longer exists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该参数已不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The paraxial curvature is c + 2β₂; β₁ has no first-order meaning." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "近轴曲率为 c + 2β₂；β₁ 没有一阶意义。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The percentiles of the builds the results report, e.g. 50, 90, 97.7" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结果中报告的成品百分位，例如 50、90、97.7"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pivot surface no longer exists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "枢轴面已不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pupil grid is set to %lld. Automatic sampling picks a grid fine enough for the wavefront's slope (64 to 1024), then runs again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光瞳网格设为 %lld。自动采样会选择足以分辨波前斜率的网格（64 至 1024），然后重新运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The range must be positive and increasing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "范围必须为正且递增。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The range must lie inside %@ (%.3f–%.3f µm)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The range must lie inside %1$@ (%2$.3f–%3$.3f µm)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "范围必须在 %1$@（%2$.3f–%3$.3f µm）之内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The response table needs at least two rows." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "响应表至少需要两行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The search's merit, including the penalty that holds the focal length; the result reports the merit itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "搜索使用的评价函数，含保持焦距的惩罚项；结果报告的是评价函数本身。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The section is drawn %lld times taller than true proportions. Click to change or turn off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "截面按真实比例的 %lld 倍高度绘制。点击以更改或关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected surface" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The semi-diameter is automatic: set a value in the lens data first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "半口径为自动：请先在镜头数据中设定一个值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sensitivity evaluations moved it from %@ to +%@ %@ of ±%@ allowed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The sensitivity evaluations moved it from %1$@ to +%2$@ %3$@ of ±%4$@ allowed"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "灵敏度评估使其从 %1$@ 变化到 +%2$@ %3$@（允许 ±%4$@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shape has no real sag over ±%@ mm." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该面型在 ±%@ mm 范围内没有实数矢高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The simulated part of the field: a square around the patch center, as a fraction of the field. A smaller patch has finer pixels, so the blur shows." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模拟的视场部分：围绕图块中心的正方形，以视场的比例表示。图块越小像素越细，模糊越明显。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The surface (a thickness is the gap after it)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面（厚度指其后的间隔）"
          }
        }
      }
